{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03006",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.33,
      "end_seconds": 4.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.24,
      "end_seconds": 10.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.45,
      "end_seconds": 16.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.08,
      "end_seconds": 21.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.05,
      "end_seconds": 31.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "It's a high sugar test in pregnancy, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.18,
      "end_seconds": 35.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.39,
      "end_seconds": 45.51,
      "duration_seconds": 9.12,
      "text": "So, I'm not sure when it began, to be honest. Some weeks ago, but I can't say how many."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.62,
      "end_seconds": 50.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.02,
      "end_seconds": 60.09,
      "duration_seconds": 9.07,
      "text": "I'd give it a five, out of ten. I've also had no symptoms, for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.37,
      "end_seconds": 64.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.89,
      "end_seconds": 69.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Yes, wheat. I get itchy skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.18,
      "end_seconds": 73.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.13,
      "end_seconds": 86.19,
      "duration_seconds": 12.06,
      "text": "I have eczema, for about ten years. My family kept telling me to get it checked. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.23,
      "end_seconds": 92.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "So, yes, eczema is known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.22,
      "end_seconds": 105.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 106.43,
      "end_seconds": 111.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "He is on hydrocortisone cream, when needed, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.28,
      "end_seconds": 116.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Yes. Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.99,
      "end_seconds": 121.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Actually, my father has Parkinson's disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.58,
      "end_seconds": 127.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.63,
      "end_seconds": 133.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.02,
      "end_seconds": 137.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.25,
      "end_seconds": 143.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.35,
      "end_seconds": 147.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.03,
      "end_seconds": 150.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.68,
      "end_seconds": 153.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.35,
      "end_seconds": 159.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.61,
      "end_seconds": 166.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "Right, have you had any reduced baby movements, blurred vision or thirst?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.09,
      "end_seconds": 170.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.73,
      "end_seconds": 175.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "And passing a lot of urine, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.84,
      "end_seconds": 181.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Not at all, no passing a lot of urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.71,
      "end_seconds": 185.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.06,
      "end_seconds": 189.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Nothing there, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.52,
      "end_seconds": 193.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.25,
      "end_seconds": 207.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.68,
      "end_seconds": 230.97,
      "duration_seconds": 11.29,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 118 over 72, height 151 centimetres, respiratory rate 16, pulse 67, temp 36.4 degrees, BMI works out to 22.8, weight 52 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.8,
      "end_seconds": 233.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.59,
      "end_seconds": 237.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.84,
      "end_seconds": 242.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Right, may I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.57,
      "end_seconds": 257.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.29,
      "end_seconds": 261.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.55,
      "end_seconds": 274.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal and your urine has no sugar today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.69,
      "end_seconds": 276.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.14,
      "end_seconds": 293.98,
      "duration_seconds": 12.84,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Let me tell you where I've got to. I think we're dealing with gestational diabetes controllable with diet at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.32,
      "end_seconds": 325.45,
      "duration_seconds": 22.13,
      "text": "I want a growth scan done, that's for gestational diabetes. I'll request a glucose meter and diary, it'll help with gestational diabetes. Replace sugary drinks and white starches with wholegrains and walk after meals. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.08,
      "end_seconds": 328.01,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.93,
      "end_seconds": 332.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I'd like you back in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.07,
      "end_seconds": 336.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.4,
      "end_seconds": 342.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.0,
      "end_seconds": 346.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}